              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বেড়ে ওঠা (beṛe oṭhā) is beṛe, the -এ form of bāṛā, \"to grow\", which CDIAL lists for Bengali under Sanskrit vardhate, \"grows\" (CDIAL 11376), with oṭhā, \"to rise\" (CDIAL 1793)."
